  ($qb$HEAIL-VSA-FIB-011$qb$, $qb$A5-04$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$You can tell a team's real priority from what it ______ when time runs short.$qb$, $qb$protects$qb$, $qb$measures$qb$, $qb$records$qb$, $qb$announces$qb$, $qb$budgets$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
