  ($qb$HEAIL-CFS-SJT-042$qb$, $qb$A5-05$qb$, $qb$SJT$qb$, $qb$You buy for a retail chain. The shops say your stock choices do not sell, and your figures say they do not display them properly. How do you approach it?$qb$, $qb$Spend a day in two shops and see what happens to the stock$qb$, $qb$Compare sales across shops that display them differently$qb$, $qb$Ask shop managers what they think does not work$qb$, $qb$Send display instructions with the stock$qb$, $qb$Buy what the shops ask for and let the figures decide$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-CFS-SJT-043$qb$, $qb$A5-05$qb$, $qb$SJT$qb$, $qb$You plan routes for a transport firm. Drivers say your plans are impossible and drivers who deviate get the best times. How do you approach it?$qb$, $qb$Ride one of the routes and see what the plan does not account for$qb$, $qb$Ask drivers where the plans go wrong$qb$, $qb$Compare planned times against actual times$qb$, $qb$Ask drivers who deviate to explain their route$qb$, $qb$Hold drivers to the planned routes$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
