  ($qb$HEAIL-CFS-SJT-045$qb$, $qb$A5-05$qb$, $qb$SJT$qb$, $qb$You work in billing at a utility. Field crews record work in a way your system cannot bill, so invoices are wrong. Crews say your form is unusable in the field. How do you approach it?$qb$, $qb$Go out with a crew and see what the form asks of them$qb$, $qb$Redesign the form with two crew members and trial it$qb$, $qb$Ask crews to write down what the form stops them recording$qb$, $qb$Ask crews to complete the form as designed$qb$, $qb$Correct the entries in billing and say nothing$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-CFS-SJT-046$qb$, $qb$A5-05$qb$, $qb$SJT$qb$, $qb$You grow produce on a farm. The packhouse rejects a share of every crop and says it arrives too ripe. You say they hold it too long before packing. How do you approach it?$qb$, $qb$Track one crop from picking to packing with someone from each side$qb$, $qb$Compare rejection rates against picking dates$qb$, $qb$Ask the packhouse how long the crop waits$qb$, $qb$Pick earlier and accept lower weight$qb$, $qb$Raise the rejection rate with the owner$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
